<div class="wysiwyg_wp"><div class="h3bg"><div><h3>株式会社三紅</h3></div></div><p>［飯谷町高良26-20　電話：088-645-2198］</p></div>
<div class="img-area">
<p class="img-left"><a class="externalLink" href="https://www.google.co.jp/maps/place/%E3%80%92771-4265+%E5%BE%B3%E5%B3%B6%E7%9C%8C%E5%BE%B3%E5%B3%B6%E5%B8%82%E9%A3%AF%E8%B0%B7%E7%94%BA%E9%AB%98%E8%89%AF%EF%BC%92%EF%BC%96%E2%88%92%EF%BC%92%EF%BC%90/@33.9871046,134.5478758,17z/data=%213m1%214b1%214m2%213m1%211s0x35530dff20a32b6b:0x613db875a9c0aff8?hl=ja" target="_blank"  rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="hannyuu.images/siminkankyo_seisaku49.jpg" width="312" height="277" alt="株式会社三紅の地図画像（外部サイト）" /></a><br /><span>Googleマップへリンク</span></p>
